    "title": "Should I Sell My House Myself? Pros & Cons · OwnersMarket",
    "description": "Selling your home without a realtor can save thousands, but it isn't for everyone. An honest look at the pros, cons and who it suits in Canada.",
    "h1": "Should I sell my house myself? An honest look at the pros and cons",
